LAMMPS (30 Sep 2026 - Development - a0e2bd6-modified)
  using 2 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
package gpu 2 split 1.0
WARNING: The 'split' keyword is deprecated. Host/device particle splitting is no longer supported. The value is ignored. (src/GPU/fix_gpu.cpp:159)
units lj
atom_style charge
boundary p p p
read_data data.lmp
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (7.1512283 7.1512283 7.1512283)
  1 by 1 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  256 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.005 seconds
pair_style lj/cut/gpu 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no
timestep 0.0001
fix integrate all nve
thermo 5
thermo_modify norm no
run 5

